    [CI] Update ops-transformer packages for v0.32.0rc (#20552)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Refresh the CANN 9.3.0 ops-transformer package URLs from the 20261028
    build to the 20261031 build for `releases/v0.32.0rc` only.
    
    The update covers the A2 (910B), A5 (950), and A3 packages for both
    aarch64 and x86_64 in the Ubuntu and openEuler Dockerfiles.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. This is a Docker build dependency refresh for the v0.32.0rc release
    branch.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - Verified all six new package URLs return HTTP 200.
    - Verified the diff is limited to six Dockerfiles and twelve `20261028`
    to `20261031` path replacements.
    - Local image builds were not run because CANN/Ascend images require the
    remote Ascend build environment.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/544f182d9f0c9bfe8bd7645525951d5e3692a542
    
    Signed-off-by: underfituu <hzhucong@163.com>

diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile
index 47a671206..b9c7641b0 100644
--- a/Dockerfile
+++ b/Dockerfile
@@ -23,9 +23,9 @@ ARG TARGETPLATFORM
 RUN ARCH=${TARGETPLATFORM:-$(uname -m)}; \
     case "$ARCH" in \
         "linux/arm64"|"aarch64") \
-            OPS_TRANSFORMER_URL="https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/package/master/20261028/aarch64/cann-910b-ops-transformer_9.3.0_linux-aarch64.run" ;; \
+            OPS_TRANSFORMER_URL="https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/package/master/20261031/aarch64/cann-910b-ops-transformer_9.3.0_linux-aarch64.run" ;; \
         "linux/amd64"|"x86_64") \
-            OPS_TRANSFORMER_URL="https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/package/master/20261028/x86_64/cann-910b-ops-transformer_9.3.0_linux-x86_64.run" ;; \
+            OPS_TRANSFORMER_URL="https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/package/master/20261031/x86_64/cann-910b-ops-transformer_9.3.0_linux-x86_64.run" ;; \
         *) echo "Skipping unsupported architecture: $ARCH" && exit 0 ;; \
     esac && \
     wget --quiet "$OPS_TRANSFORMER_URL" -O /tmp/cann-910b-ops-transformer.run && \
